<title>USA: ValuJet to resume Fort Myers service.</title>
<headline>ValuJet to resume Fort Myers service.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>ValuJet Airlines said on Wednesday it planned to resume service between Fort Myers, Florida, and Atlanta with two daily round trips on January 16.</p>
<p>Earlier in the day, ValuJet won approval from the U.S. Federal Aviation Administration to add three aircraft to its fleet, bringing its total to 18.</p>
<p>ValuJet operates 116 daily departures on peak days to 18 cities.</p>
